    - vinByIDResolver          (*database.VehicleRepo.GetByID -> teslapipeline.VINResolver.VINByID)
    Both are minimal one-method bridges. The MQTT subscriber's
    VIN-string-to-int64 resolver (the dual direction) is an inline
    func literal because it needs to map the "vehicle not registered"
    case to mqtt.ErrUnknownVIN, which is a behaviour specific to that
    call site (the SideEffectsObserver lookup, by contrast, does not
    have an equivalent sentinel because its callers swallow lookup
    failures with a WARN log).

